\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Still the night, holy the night!
\par Sleeps the world; hid from sight,
\par Mary and Joseph in stable bare
\par Watch o'er the Child beloved and fair,
\par Sleeping in heavenly rest.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Still the night, holy the night!
\par Shepherds first saw the light,
\par Heard resounding clear and long,
\par Far and near, the angel-song,
\par Christ the Redeemer is here!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Still the night, holy the night!
\par Son of God, O how bright
\par Love is smiling from Thy face!
\par Strikes for us now the hour of grace,
\par Saviour, since Thou art born!\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

